aw\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, जब भी कोई नागरिक किसी विधि को पसंद करे\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Yes, without identifying any right\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, किसी अधिकार की पहचान के बिना\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"No\",\"hi\":\"नहीं\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Only a municipality can do so\",\"hi\":\"केवल नगर निकाय ऐसा कर सकता है\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=10 — 2023 INSC 701, paragraph 12, PDF page 10: no mandamus to legislate in a particular manner; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=8 — 2023 INSC 701, paragraph 9, PDF page 8: existing right and corresponding State obligation\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Union of India v. K. Pushpavanam\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=10\",\"citation\":\"2023 INSC 701, paragraph 12, PDF page 10: no mandamus to legislate in a particular manner\"},{\"title\":\"Union of India v. K. Pushpavanam\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=8\",\"citation\":\"2023 INSC 701, paragraph 9, PDF page 8: existing right and corresponding State obligation\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"K. Pushpavanam judgment, paragraph 12, official PDF page 10; K. Pushpavanam judgment, paragraph 9, official PDF page 8\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"ed7c4df8-d919-4111-a443-29d9607741a1\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Article 22(3) excludes which two categories from clauses (1) and (2)?\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 22(3) किन दो श्रेणियों को खंड (1) और (2) से बाहर रखता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Enemy aliens and persons arrested or detained under preventive-detention law\",\"hi\":\"शत्रु अन्यदेशीय और निवारक-निरोध विधि के अधीन गिरफ्तार या निरुद्ध व्यक्ति\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"All citizens and all children\",\"hi\":\"सभी नागरिक और सभी बच्चे\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Only convicted prisoners and witnesses\",\"hi\":\"केवल दोषसिद्ध बंदी और साक्षी\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Legislators and judges\",\"hi\":\"विधायक और न्यायाधीश\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=43 — Part III, Article 22(2)-(4) and current-text footnote, PDF page 43 (document page 12); Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=44 — Part III, Article 22(4)-(7), PDF page 44 (document page 13); National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT) — https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps202.pdf#page=10 — Printed page 35, PDF page 10: preventive detention and reasonable restrictions\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=43\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Article 22(2)-(4) and current-text footnote, PDF page 43 (document page 12)\"},{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=44\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Article 22(4)-(7), PDF page 44 (document page 13)\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Indian Constitution at Work, Class XI, Chapter 2: Rights in the Indian Constitution (Reprint 2026-27)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps202.pdf#page=10\",\"citation\":\"Printed page 35, PDF page 10: preventive detention and reasonable restrictions\"}],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Article 22(2)-(4), official PDF page 43; Constitution of India, Article 22(4)-(7), official PDF page 44; NCERT Class XI, Indian Constitution at Work, Chapter 2, printed page 35\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"ec8eaf78-3f04-4984-abc1-b65f24fd6ed8\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"A statute regulates the commercial accounting and fee collection of a pilgrimage body without prescribing religious doctrine. Which provision most directly supports such regulation?\",\"hi\":\"एक विधि तीर्थ-निकाय के वाणिज्यिक लेखों और शुल्क-संग्रह का विनियमन करती है, पर धार्मिक सिद्धांत निर्धारित नहीं करती। कौन-सा उपबंध ऐसे विनियमन का सबसे सीधा समर्थन करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Article 25(2)(a), concerning secular activities associated with religious practice\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 25(2)(a), जो धार्मिक आचरण से जुड़ी लौकिक गतिविधियों से संबंधित है\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Article 28(3), concerning consent in schools\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 28(3), जो विद्यालयों में सहमति से संबंधित है\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Article 27, as a ban on all accounting\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 27, सभी लेखांकन पर निषेध के रूप में\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Article 26(c), as immunity from every law\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 26(c), प्रत्येक विधि से उन्मुक्ति के रूप में\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=45 — Part III, Article 25 and Article 26 opening, PDF page 45 (document page 14); Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46 — Part III, Articles 26(b)-(d), 27 and 28, PDF page 46 (document page 15)\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=45\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Article 25 and Article 26 opening, PDF page 45 (document page 14)\"},{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Articles 26(b)-(d), 27 and 28, PDF page 46 (document page 15)\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Article 25 and Article 26 opening, official PDF page 45; Constitution of India, Articles 26-28, official PDF page 46\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"eb8afc2d-2288-47f1-b212-3943597bda68\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Does Article 30(1) limit a minority to establishing only institutions that teach its religion or language?\",\"hi\":\"क्या अनुच्छेद 30(1) अल्पसंख्यक को केवल उसका धर्म या भाषा पढ़ाने वाली संस्था स्थापित करने तक सीमित करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Yes, in every case\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, प्रत्येक मामले में\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Yes, but only for aided institutions\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, पर केवल सहायता-प्राप्त संस्थाओं में\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Yes, because the word “choice” is absent\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, क्योंकि “पसंद” शब्द नहीं है\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"No; the text protects educational institutions “of their choice”\",\"hi\":\"नहीं; पाठ “अपनी पसंद की” शैक्षणिक संस्थाओं की रक्षा करता है\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46 — Part III, Articles 29 and 30(1), PDF page 46 (document page 15); Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2024/14432/14432_2024_1_1502_56834_Judgement_05-Nov-2024.pdf#page=53 — Judgment, paragraphs 77-78, PDF page 53: balancing excellence with Article 30 administration\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Articles 29 and 30(1), PDF page 46 (document page 15)\"},{\"title\":\"Anjum Kadari v. Union of India, 2024 INSC 831\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2024/14432/14432_2024_1_1502_56834_Judgement_05-Nov-2024.pdf#page=53\",\"citation\":\"Judgment, paragraphs 77-78, PDF page 53: balancing excellence with Article 30 administration\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Articles 29 and 30(1), official PDF page 46; Anjum Kadari judgment, paragraphs 77-78, official Supreme Court PDF page 53\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"eb2865fb-a825-49fa-b07d-da036eb4f4d4\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"What does the right to an efficient and expeditious acquisition process require?\",\"hi\":\"दक्ष और शीघ्र अर्जन-प्रक्रिया का अधिकार क्या अपेक्षा करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Proceedings should follow prescribed timelines without avoidable delay\",\"hi\":\"कार्यवाही निर्धारित समय-सीमाओं के अनुसार अनावश्यक विलंब के बिना चले\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"The State may keep proceedings pending forever\",\"hi\":\"राज्य कार्यवाही अनिश्चितकाल लंबित रख सकता है\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Notice may always be skipped\",\"hi\":\"सूचना सदैव छोड़ी जा सकती है\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Compensation may never be determined\",\"hi\":\"प्रतिकर कभी निर्धारित न किया जाए\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2023/14014/14014_2023_2_1501_58185_Judgement_02-Jan-2025.pdf#page=46 — 2025 judgment, paragraphs 41, 43-45, PDF page 46: expeditious process, conclusion, fair compensation and corresponding State duties; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2023/14014/14014_2023_2_1501_58185_Judgement_02-Jan-2025.pdf#page=47 — 2025 judgment, paragraphs 46-48, PDF page 47: constitutional/human right, rehabilitation and timely payment of compensation\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"State of Himachal Pradesh v. Rajesh Chander Sood\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2023/14014/14014_2023_2_1501_58185_Judgement_02-Jan-2025.pdf#page=46\",\"citation\":\"2025 judgment, paragraphs 41, 43-45, PDF page 46: expeditious process, conclusion, fair compensation and corresponding State duties\"},{\"title\":\"State of Himachal Pradesh v. Rajesh Chander Sood\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2023/14014/14014_2023_2_1501_58185_Judgement_02-Jan-2025.pdf#page=47\",\"citation\":\"2025 judgment, paragraphs 