rtment, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46 — Part III, Articles 26(b)-(d), 27 and 28, PDF page 46 (document page 15)\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=45\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Article 25 and Article 26 opening, PDF page 45 (document page 14)\"},{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=46\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Articles 26(b)-(d), 27 and 28, PDF page 46 (document page 15)\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Article 25 and Article 26 opening, official PDF page 45; Constitution of India, Articles 26-28, official PDF page 46\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"e8f026ee-c944-4c07-a4d5-9db631947327\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"A criminal law punishes “annoying” online messages but gives neither citizens nor police a workable standard. Which case is the closest authority?\",\"hi\":\"कोई दंड-विधि “कष्टप्रद” ऑनलाइन संदेशों को दंडित करती है, किंतु नागरिकों या पुलिस को कोई कार्यसाध्य मानक नहीं देती। कौन-सा मामला सबसे निकट प्राधिकार है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Joseph Shine\",\"hi\":\"जोसेफ शाइन\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"NALSA\",\"hi\":\"NALSA\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Shreya Singhal\",\"hi\":\"श्रेया सिंघल\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Vishaka\",\"hi\":\"विशाखा\"}},\"difficulty\"