b-432f-bb61-6a8398d01bf4\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"What does section 3A generally prohibit for adolescents?\",\"hi\":\"धारा 3A सामान्यतः कुमारों के लिए क्या निषिद्ध करती है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"All school education\",\"hi\":\"सभी विद्यालयी शिक्षा\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Employment or permitted work in hazardous occupations or processes listed in the Schedule\",\"hi\":\"अनुसूची में सूचीबद्ध परिसंकटमय उपजीविकाओं या प्रक्रियाओं में नियोजन अथवा कार्य की अनुमति\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Every non-hazardous hobby\",\"hi\":\"हर गैर-परिसंकटमय शौक\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"All sports participation\",\"hi\":\"सभी खेल सहभागिता\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: India Code, Legislative Department, Government of India — https://www.indiacode.nic.in/bitstream/123456789/19582/1/the_child_and_adolescent_labour_%28prohibition_and_regulation%29_act%2C_1986_no._61_of_1986_date_23.12.1986.pdf#page=2 — Sections 1-2, PDF page 2: current definitions of child and adolescent; India Code, Legislative Department, Government of India — https://www.indiacode.nic.in/bitstream/123456789/19582/1/the_child_and_adolescent_labour_%28prohibition_and_regulation%29_act%2C_1986_no._61_of_1986_date_23.12.1986.pdf#page=3 — Sections 3, 3A, 4 and 5, PDF page 3: child-work prohibition, exceptions and hazardous adolescent work\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Child and Adolescent Labour (Prohibition and Regulation) Act, 1986 (Act 61 of 1986)\",\"institution\":\"India Code, Legislative Department, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.indiacode.nic.in/bitstream/123456789/19582/1/the_child_and_adolescent_labour_%28prohibition_and_regulation%29_act%2C_1986_no._61_of_1986_date_23.12.1986.pdf#page=2\",\"citation\":\"Sections 1-2, PDF page 2: current definitions of child and adolescent\"},{\"title\":\"The Child and Adolescent Labour (Prohibition and Regulation) Act, 1986 (Act 61 of 1986)\",\"institution\":\"India Code, Legislative De